3. Lock the local Harbor app boundary
   Scope: define `apps/harbor-local` as a fully offline local MCP plugin console built on Harbor SDK. Exclude WorkOS, hosted Harbor auth, hosted workspaces, Cloudflare runtime, Orbit, workflows, apps, jobs, chat/agents, STDIO MCP, vector search, and write confirmations from v1.
